## Error Handling

### Graceful Degradation
- Implement fallback providers when primary fails
- Cache successful results to reduce dependency
- Provide meaningful error messages to users
- Log detailed errors for debugging

### Rate Limiting
- Respect external API rate limits
- Implement exponential backoff for retries
- Use distributed caching to reduce API calls
- Monitor and alert on rate limit violations

## Security Considerations

### Web Scraping
- Respect robots.txt files
- Implement proper user-agent strings
- Use proxy rotation when necessary
- Monitor for IP blocking

### Data Protection
- Encrypt sensitive configuration data
- Implement proper authentication for APIs
- Validate all input data
- Sanitize output data

## Performance Optimization

### Caching Strategy
